part rec_lazur
  tally 2
  note "Bank Lazur, Jan's account LN88 1020 0044 9172 (records/lazur-jan.csv): one row per movement on either side; lf the floren side, ld the dukat side, each as it stands (dr out, cr in, bal the side's balance after it). k classifies the type and counterparty (data); m is the month a pay or a part row names, q the quarter a Kindergeld row names, rate and duk the rate and dukats a sale row's text names."

version lazur_jan
  cite lazur_export
  governs always
